{
 "contentDe": {
  "root": {
   "children": [
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "Ich bin wie das sprichwörtliche hektische Eichhörnchen: immer abgelenkt und angezogen von der nächsten Nuss. Die Nüsse sind in diesem Fall Innovationen, zufällige inspirierende Fundstücke, die Recherche nach dem besten Produkt für X und so weiter. Manchmal finde ich auch die Ruhe, sitzen zu bleiben und längere Blogbeiträge zu schreiben.",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "All das, was Dich vielleicht auslaugt – sich in noch ein Thema einzugraben, das beste Zeug zu finden, umsetzbare Wege zu einem glücklicheren und lustigeren Leben zu entdecken und das alles aufzuschreiben –, liebe ich, und es gibt mir Energie. Lass mich meine Erkenntnisse und meine Energie an Dich weitergeben!",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "Erwarte breit gestreutes Futter für Deinen Kopf aus meinen Interessengebieten: Innovation & Technologie, Glück & menschlicher Geist, Geldanlage & persönliche Finanzen, Gesundheit & Fitness, Startups.",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "Was Dich erwartet: Praktische Tipps, wie Du Dich in KI, Leben, Gesundheit & Geldanlage zurechtfindest; inspirierende Gedanken; die interessantesten Bücher, Videos und Artikel; Produktempfehlungen – im Grunde die Ergebnisse meiner neurotisch ausführlichen Recherchen nach „dem besten Produkt für X“; Hintergründe zu meinen neuen Projekten und vieles mehr.",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    }
   ],
   "direction": null,
   "format": "",
   "indent": 0,
   "type": "root",
   "version": 1
  }
 },
 "contentEn": {
  "root": {
   "children": [
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "I am like the proverbial hectic squirrel: always distracted and attracted by the next nut. Nut in this case being innovations, random inspiring stuff, researching the best product for X, etc. Sometimes I find the time to stay put and write longer blog posts.",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "All this stuff that might drain you – digging into yet another topic, finding the best stuff, finding actionable ways to live a happier, more fun life, writing all this out – I love it and it gives me energy. Let me pass on my insights and energy to you!",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "Expect wide-ranging fuel for your mind from my areas of interest: Innovation & Technology, Happiness & Human Mind, Investing & Personal Finance, Health & Fitness, Startups.",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "What you can expect: practical tips on navigating AI, life, health & investing; inspiring thoughts; the most interesting books, videos, and articles; product recommendations – essentially the results of my neurotically extensive research into “the best product for X”; background information on my new projects, etc.",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    }
   ],
   "direction": null,
   "format": "",
   "indent": 0,
   "type": "root",
   "version": 1
  }
 },
